---
import { DOCS_URL } from "../lib/site";
---
<section class="m-section" id="discovery" aria-labelledby="discovery-title">
 <div class="tools-heading"><div><div class="m-eyebrow">Search, analytics, and link checks</div><h2 class="m-title" id="discovery-title">See what readers<br/><em>find and follow.</em></h2></div><p class="m-copy">Check how a post can appear in search, see what brings people to it, and fix the links they rely on.</p></div>
 <div class="growth-tools">
 <article class="m-shell seo-tool"><div class="m-panel tool-inner"><div class="tool-label">Search appearance</div><div class="search-demo"><span>yoursite.com / blog / july-release</span><h3>What changed in our July release</h3><p>A shorter setup flow, faster search, and what we changed after the first week.</p></div><h3>Check your post before publishing.</h3><p class="m-soft">Preview the search title and description. Get reminders for missing image descriptions or headings. The Next.js starter includes search metadata, a sitemap, and RSS.</p><a class="m-link" href={DOCS_URL+"/docs/seo"}>Explore SEO tools</a></div></article>
 <article class="m-shell"><div class="m-panel tool-inner"><div class="tool-label">Reader analytics</div><div class="click-preview">
   <p>Example report · Link clicks</p>
   <dl>
    <div><dt>Setup guide</dt><dd><meter aria-label="Setup guide clicks" min="0" max="50" value="46">46</meter><span>46</span></dd></div>
    <div><dt>Release notes</dt><dd><meter aria-label="Release notes clicks" min="0" max="50" value="27">27</meter><span>27</span></dd></div>
   </dl>
  </div><h3>See where readers go next.</h3><p class="m-soft">On new blogs, there’s no reader tracking unless you turn it on. Enable analytics to see popular articles, referring websites, and clicked links. Readers can opt out.</p><a class="m-link" href={DOCS_URL+"/docs/analytics"}>Explore analytics</a></div></article>
 <article class="m-shell"><div class="m-panel tool-inner"><div class="tool-label">Link health</div><div class="link-example"><span>Installation guide</span><span class="link-healthy">Healthy</span></div><div class="link-example"><span>An older reference</span><span class="link-review">Review link</span></div><h3>Find links that need attention.</h3><p class="m-soft">See broken links and redirects alongside the articles that contain them. Find older posts that need an internal link and check when each destination was last scanned.</p><a class="m-link" href={DOCS_URL+"/docs/analytics#link-health"}>Explore link reports</a></div></article>
 </div>
</section>
<style>.tools-heading{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.35fr 1fr;align-items:end;gap:70px;margin-bottom:48px}.tools-heading .m-copy{margin:0}.growth-tools{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr;gap:22px}.seo-tool{grid-row:span 2}.tool-inner{height:100%;padding:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:17px}.tool-label{font:400 .72rem var(--mono);color:var(--text-muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.09em}.search-demo{padding:40px 0 48px}.search-demo span{font-size:.75rem;color:var(--text-muted)}.search-demo h3{color:#c5cddc;font-size:1.5rem;margin:14px 0 12px}.search-demo p{font-size:.92rem;color:var(--text-muted)}.tool-inner>.m-soft{font-size:.94rem}.tool-inner>.m-link{margin-top:auto;align-self:start}.click-preview{background:#151811;border:1px solid #d5ed7223;border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px;color:#d1d7b7}.click-preview>p{font:.65rem var(--mono);color:#adb692;margin-bottom:9px}.click-preview dl{margin:0;display:grid;gap:9px}.click-preview dl div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(88px,.8fr) 1fr;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.78rem}.click-preview dd{margin:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 24px;align-items:center;gap:9px;font:400 .7rem var(--mono)}.click-preview meter{width:100%;height:8px;appearance:none;accent-color:#cce876}.click-preview meter::-webkit-meter-bar{background:#303524;border:0;height:6px}.click-preview meter::-webkit-meter-optimum-value{background:#c5dd73}.link-example{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;color:var(--text-muted);font-size:.8rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);padding:10px 0}.link-healthy{color:#b7c896}.link-review{color:#d3bc85}@media(max-width:800px){.tools-heading{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px}.growth-tools{grid-template-columns:1fr}.seo-tool{grid-row:auto}.search-demo{padding:25px 0 30px}.tool-inner{padding:25px}}</style>
